354				// proposal is annotated (not collapsed — recall keeps its record
355				// shape), matching the guard the unified query/search/get path
356				// applies. Groups are built from the unfiltered branch set so
357				// scope/kind/locus filters cannot hide a pending relationship.
358				// Nothing surfaced means no annotation and no queue warning, so skip
359				// the proposal read entirely on the empty-recall path.
360				var proposals []factProposal
361				var proposalsErr error
