    "body": "Implemented on `feat/bm25-facts-ranker` (head `eae07cbf`, now linked to this trail).\n\n- `abc82f8d`: BM25 facts ranker in-process; embedder, 31 MB model asset, vector caches, RRF fusion, cgo vec0 store, ollama backend, and fusion arms deleted. Binary 66 → 33.8 MB; download 44.7 → 18.2 MB.\n- `eae07cbf`: docs/vsearch decisions folded in — doc source lexical-only (FTS always-on), `vsearch`/`--semantic` alias to BM25 with a stderr deprecation notice, contract comments updated, docs-unmeasured caveat added to the ledger row.\n\nVerification: static eval on the rebuilt live brains beats the removed semantic stack on useful/1k on all three corpora (2.658 vs 1.995; 7.215 vs 7.141; XL recall 0.223 vs 0.170); `go vet`/`gofmt` clean; full suite green except the pre-existing ollama-envelope timing flake (fails identically on clean main).\n\nOpen follow-up tracked separately: the proposal-queue poisoning bug.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
    "replies": []
  }
}

